    <Major>Movement Optimization</Major>
    <Description>Movement Slide - Beta is a customizable movement macro designed for Blood Strike players looking to improve consistency during slide-based movement techniques.

Features:
• Adjustable slide timing
• Lightweight and responsive
• Easy to customize
• Compatible with most mice and keyboards
• Designed for smooth movement execution

Version: Beta v1.0

Note: Test and adjust settings based on your personal sensitivity, hardware, and gameplay preferences.</Description>
